     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><h4><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"line-height:24px\">Hi Shiny </span>community<span style=\"line-height:24px\">,</span></font></h4><div><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"line-height:24px\">I am new in Shiny, and I have a couple question to ask you guys:</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"line-height:24px\"><br></span></font></div><div><font size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#ff9900\"><span style=\"line-height:23.999998092651367px\">First:</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"line-height:24px\">How can I change the color of the text in headerPanel ( or </span><span style=\"line-height:23.999998092651367px\">wherever text</span><span style=\"line-height:24px\">)  in the shinyUI?</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"line-height:24px\"><br></span></font></div><div><font size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#ff9900\"><span style=\"line-height:24px\">Second:</span></font></div><div><div style=\"line-height:22.719999313354492px\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\">I want plot a raster and I want also mark some points on it.</font></div><div style=\"line-height:22.719999313354492px\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\">when I click in a location, the points appears in other location.</font></div><div style=\"line-height:22.719999313354492px\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\">Is it about precision? </font></div><div style=\"line-height:22.719999313354492px\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\">How can we solver this problem?</font></div><div style=\"line-height:22.719999313354492px\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div style=\"line-height:22.719999313354492px\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\">The code is:</font></div><div style=\"line-height:22.719999313354492px\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div style=\"line-height:22.719999313354492px\"><font style=\"line-height:normal\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\"># ui</font></div><div style=\"line-height:22.719999313354492px\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\">shinyUI(basicPage(</span><br></font></div><div style=\"line-height:22.719999313354492px\"><div><font style=\"line-height:normal\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\">  plotOutput(&quot;myplot&quot;, clickId = &quot;myplot_click&quot;, width = 500, height = 500),</font></div><div><font style=\"line-height:normal\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\">  tableOutput(&quot;mytable&quot;)</font></div><div><font style=\"line-height:normal\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\">))</font></div></div><div style=\"line-height:22.719999313354492px\"><font style=\"line-height:normal\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><br style=\"line-height:22.719999313354492px\"></font></div><div style=\"line-height:22.719999313354492px\"><font style=\"line-height:normal\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><br style=\"line-height:22.719999313354492px\"></font></div><div style=\"line-height:22.719999313354492px\"><font style=\"line-height:normal\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\"># server</font></div><div style=\"line-height:22.719999313354492px\"><font style=\"line-height:normal\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\">shinyServer(function(input, output, session) {</font></div><div style=\"line-height:22.719999313354492px\"><font style=\"line-height:normal\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\">   </font></div><div style=\"line-height:22.719999313354492px\"><font style=\"line-height:normal\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\">  require(raster)</font></div><div style=\"line-height:22.719999313354492px\"><font style=\"line-height:normal\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\">  require(sp)</font></div><div style=\"line-height:22.719999313354492px\"><font style=\"line-height:normal\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\">  r &lt;- raster(xmn=525916.5, xmx=525977.5, ymn=3377900, ymx=3377961, ncols=40, nrows=40)</font></div><div style=\"line-height:22.719999313354492px\"><font style=\"line-height:normal\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\">  r &lt;- setValues(r, 1:ncell(r))</font></div><div style=\"line-height:22.719999313354492px\"><font style=\"line-height:normal\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\"> </font></div><div style=\"line-height:22.719999313354492px\"><font style=\"line-height:normal\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\">  click_points_data &lt;- data.frame(x = numeric(), y = numeric())</font></div><div style=\"line-height:22.719999313354492px\"><font style=\"line-height:normal\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\">  </font></div><div style=\"line-height:22.719999313354492px\"><font style=\"line-height:normal\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\">  click_points &lt;- reactive({</font></div><div style=\"line-height:22.719999313354492px\"><font style=\"line-height:normal\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\">    newpoint &lt;- input$myplot_click</font></div><div style=\"line-height:22.719999313354492px\"><font style=\"line-height:normal\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\">    if (!is.null(newpoint))</font></div><div style=\"line-height:22.719999313354492px\"><font style=\"line-height:normal\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\">      click_points_data &lt;&lt;- data.frame(</font></div><div style=\"line-height:22.719999313354492px\"><font style=\"line-height:normal\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\">        x = c(click_points_data$x, newpoint$x),</font></div><div style=\"line-height:22.719999313354492px\"><font style=\"line-height:normal\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\">        y = c(click_points_data$y, newpoint$y))</font></div><div style=\"line-height:22.719999313354492px\"><font style=\"line-height:normal\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\">    click_points_data</font></div><div style=\"line-height:22.719999313354492px\"><font style=\"line-height:normal\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\">  })</font></div><div style=\"line-height:22.719999313354492px\"><font style=\"line-height:normal\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\"> </font></div><div style=\"line-height:22.719999313354492px\"><font style=\"line-height:normal\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\">  output$myplot &lt;- renderPlot({</font></div><div style=\"line-height:22.719999313354492px\"><font style=\"line-height:normal\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\">   </font></div><div style=\"line-height:22.719999313354492px\"><font style=\"line-height:normal\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\">    plot(r)</font></div><div style=\"line-height:22.719999313354492px\"><font style=\"line-height:normal\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\">    grid()</font></div><div style=\"line-height:22.719999313354492px\"><font style=\"line-height:normal\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\">    points(click_points()$x, click_points()$y, col = &quot;red&quot;)</font></div><div style=\"line-height:22.719999313354492px\"><font style=\"line-height:normal\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\">  })</font></div><div style=\"line-height:22.719999313354492px\"><font style=\"line-height:normal\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\">  output$mytable &lt;- renderTable({</font></div><div style=\"line-height:22.719999313354492px\"><font style=\"line-height:normal\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\">    data.frame(type = rep(&quot;click&quot;, nrow(click_points())), click_points())</font></div><div style=\"line-height:22.719999313354492px\"><font style=\"line-height:normal\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\">  })</font></div><div style=\"line-height:22.719999313354492px\"><font style=\"line-height:normal\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\">})</font></div></div><div style=\"line-height:22.719999313354492px\"><font style=\"line-height:normal\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\">I will appreciate any help!</font></div><div style=\"line-height:22.719999313354492px\"><font style=\"line-height:normal\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\">Thank you so much! </font></div><div style=\"line-height:22.719999313354492px\"><font style=\"line-height:normal\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\">Best Regards</font></div><div style=\"line-height:22.719999313354492px\"><font style=\"line-height:normal\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\">ForestCAS</font></div></div>"
